    <key>readme</key>
    <string>onx — find a note or artifact by its title (with nothing typed: the pages changed most recently).
onxc — find one by the words inside it.
↩ opens the page in Onyx · ⌘C copies its path · ⌘Y previews it.

Universal Actions ▸ Open in Onyx opens a selected HTML, Markdown, text, or PDF document.

Onyx.app must be installed; it need not be running. The folders searched are the ones set in Onyx ▸ Settings ▸ Vaults.</string>
